WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:01.301 line:0%
.

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:05.572 line:0%
THE COMMITTEE HAS THEIR NEXT

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.339 line:0%
HEARING COMING OUT.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:10.510 line:0%
&gt;&gt; KATELYN POLANTZ, THANK YOU.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:14.147 line:0%
THIS MORNING, RUSSIANS LINING

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:16.182 line:0%
UP TO FLEE THE NATION AS

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:16.716 line:0%
LATERAL PUTIN INTENSIFIES

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.252 line:0%
AGAINST UKRAINE.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:20.420 line:0%
RUSSIAN FORCES HAVE BEEN DRIVEN

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:22.222 line:0%
OUT OF THE NEWLY LIBERATED CITY

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:23.490 line:0%
OF KUPIANSK IN UKRAINE.

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:26.126 line:0%
THE ECHO OF DANGEROUS SHELLING

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:27.560 line:0%
NEARBY REMAINS AND THE CITY

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:29.229 line:0%
MIGHT BE FREE OF THE RUSSIANS

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:30.663 line:0%
FAR FROM STATE.

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:31.131 line:0%
AS BEN WEDEMAN REPORTS FROM THE

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.435 line:0%
FRONT LINES.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:36.636 line:0%
&gt;&gt; FOR A FEW LOAVES OF BREAD,

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:37.103 line:0%
RESIDENTS OF KUPIANSK RISK

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:43.643 line:0%
THEIR LIVES.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:45.812 line:0%
UKRAINIAN FORCES RETAKE THE

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.813 line:0%
CITY ABOUT TWO WEEKS AGO, BUT

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:49.482 line:0%
THE FIGHTING IS FAR FROM OVER.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.883 line:0%
JULIETTE DESCRIBES IT IN ONE

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:50.283 line:0%
WORD --

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:55.188 line:0%
INTENSE.

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:55.922 line:0%
THAT IS THE ECHO OF CLUSTER

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:58.224 line:0%
BOMBS FALLING NOT FAR AWAY.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:02.929 line:0%
&gt;&gt; [SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:04.964 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SOMETIMES I'M SCARED, SAYS

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:05.398 line:0%
DANIIL OVER THE SOUND OF NEARBY

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.232 line:0%
SHELLING.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.134 line:0%
SOMETIMES, I DON'T CARE.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.601 line:0%
THESE ARE THE FEW PEOPLE LEFT

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:10.904 line:0%
IN KUPIANSK.

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:12.105 line:0%
EVEN THOUGH THIS CITY

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.907 line:0%
THEORETICALLY THE RUSSIANS HAVE

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:14.474 line:0%
LEFT, THE RUSSIANS ARE JUST

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:16.342 line:0%
ACROSS THE RIVER.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:18.912 line:0%
ACCORDING TO THE SOLDIERS HERE,

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:21.114 line:0%
THERE ARE STILL RUSSIANS INSIDE

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.581 line:0%
THE UKRAINIAN-CONTROLLED PART

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:25.685 line:0%
OF THE CITY.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.920 line:0%
RUSSIAN FORCES TOOK CONTROL OF

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:28.154 line:0%
KUPIANSK WITH A LITTLE FIGHTING

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:30.657 line:0%
IN THE FIRST DAYS OF THE WAR.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:31.891 line:0%
IT SERVED AS THE ADMINISTRATIVE

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:32.625 line:0%
CENTER FOR THE RUSSIAN OCCUPIED

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:37.630 line:0%
PART OF THE KHARKIV REGION.

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:38.031 line:0%
PRO-RUSSIAN SYMPATHIES LINGER

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.333 line:0%
ON HERE.

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.767 line:0%
THE RUSSIANS PAID SALARIES AND

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.736 line:0%
PENSIONS.

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:44.571 line:0%
THE RECENT UKRAINIAN COUNTER

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:47.340 line:0%
OFFENSIVE TURNED THIS CITY INTO

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:49.442 line:0%
A WAR ZONE, SPARKING RESENTMENT

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:52.312 line:0%
AGAINST BOTH SIDES.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.712 line:0%
THEY ARE ONE OF THE SAME, SAYS

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:54.514 line:0%
ONE MAN.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.448 line:0%
THE MOOD OF THE POPULATION IS

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:58.351 line:0%
SHOCKED.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:59.085 line:0%
IT'S TOO EARLY AND TOO

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:03.022 line:0%
DANGEROUS.

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:03.490 line:0%
RECORD IS STILL SCATTERED IN

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:11.564 line:0%
THE STREETS.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:13.867 line:0%
THERE IS A FAIRLY CONSTANT

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:15.668 line:0%
INCOMING AND OUTGOING ARTILLERY

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.036 line:0%
AND ROCKET FIRE HERE.

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:20.607 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AN HOURS DRIVE AWAY IN THE

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:21.875 line:0%
TOWN OF IZYUM, NO SHELLING, BUT

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:23.543 line:0%
SHELL-SHOCKED STILL SHOW ON THE

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.910 line:0%
FACES OF PEOPLE WAITING FOR

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.813 line:0%
FOOD.

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:27.580 line:0%
THE FIGHTING HAS MOVED ON.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:31.484 line:0%
THIS CAR AS IT LEFT ALREADY.

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.918 line:0%
THEY HIT MY HOME, SAYS

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:35.755 line:0%
LYUDMYLA.

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:40.994 line:0%
WAR SPARES NO ONE, AS CATARINA.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:42.495 line:0%
THE LOCAL FIRE STATION HAS

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:42.996 line:0%
BECOME A WAREHOUSE FOR SUPPLIES

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:46.432 line:0%
DONATED BY --

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:47.167 line:0%
IN HER GRANDFATHER'S ARMS,

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:53.473 line:0%
ALINA CALLS INTENSE BOMBING.

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:53.840 line:0%
IT KILLED OUR DOG AND HIT THE

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:54.641 line:0%
ROOF.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.074 line:0%
WE WERE HIDING IN THE BASEMENT,

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:58.578 line:0%
SHE SAYS.

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.578 line:0%
BACK IN KUPIANSK, TA

